  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/07/19693619_1342997512457896_2827781242228304145_o.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">Ensayos, recreo y actuaciones finales en la 2&ordf; &#39;Summer Fun Week&#39; de Kids&amp;Us Onda, &#39;School of English&#39; situada en la pla&ccedil;a de les Corts Valencianes, 9, en un entorno de plazas y jardines donde este verano ni&ntilde;os y ni&ntilde;as pueden disfrutar, siempre en ingl&eacute;s,&nbsp;durante&nbsp;el mes de julio con tem&aacute;ticas diferentes.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2afunssummerwekkidsampusonda/18kidsusonda-1.jpg\" alt=\"18kidsusonda-1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2afunssummerwekkidsampusonda/18kidsusonda-10.jpg\" alt=\"18kidsusonda-10\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2afunssummerwekkidsampusonda/18kidsusonda-11.jpg\" alt=\"18kidsusonda-11\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2afunssummerwekkidsampusonda/18kidsusonda-12.jpg\" alt=\"18kidsusonda-12\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2afunssummerwekkidsampusonda/18kidsusonda-13.jpg\" alt=\"18kidsusonda-13\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2afunssummerwekkidsampusonda/18kidsusonda-2.jpg\" alt=\"18kidsusonda-2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2afunssummerwekkidsampusonda/18kidsusonda-3.jpg\" alt=\"18kidsusonda-3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><i